{"id":"nikogda","lemma":"никогда","pos":"adv","rank":81,"glosses":["never, nevermore (entails the meaning \"always\" or \"for now on\")"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/50/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Теперь или никогда.","en":"It's now or never.","words":[{"g":"now, at present"},{"g":"or"},null]},{"text":"Лучше позже, чем никогда.","en":"Better late than never.","words":[{"g":"rather, would better )"},null,{"g":"than"},null]},{"text":"Я никогда не буду твоей.","en":"I'll never be yours.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"}]},{"text":"Тебе меня никогда не остановить.","en":"You'll never stop me.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to stop"}]},{"text":"Я никогда об этом не думаю.","en":"I never think about it.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"about"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"I don't think so"]]}]}